                                                "sense_id": "9d3c3ac9-d99c-393a-86ed-d02ad61859f3",
                                                "text": "According to a list of participants on the forum’s website, the CEOs of Goldman Sachs (GS) and Morgan Stanley (MS) still plan to go. Both banks declined to comment. But a person familiar with the situation said Goldman’s Lloyd Blankfein was “unlikely to attend.”"
